{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our debut title,\u00a0<strong>Soukh</strong>, you play as an exiled merchant striving to rebuild his legacy by running a bazaar in his hometown. It blends light strategy, management sim mechanics, and quirky minigames, all wrapped in a rich fantasy world. Made in Unreal Engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soukh</strong> offers a fresh take with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An innovative way to introduce shopkeeping management, making it more stress-based, inspired by real-life Middle Eastern Bazaars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expedition systems involving hiring members and tackling challenges on the road with cool minigames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Turn rot to royalty, as you upgrade your small village into a bustling town!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3900970?t=1756094882","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/e129d14e45dc4fd9a1f4aa1ccc6ae68806a96243/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756094882","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/2e63feaff186336da46375ac81d2aea36a6fed3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756094882","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/2e63feaff186336da46375ac81d2aea36a6fed3b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756094882","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our debut title,\u00a0<strong>Soukh</strong>, you play as an exiled merchant str